      "comment": "Varka: Barbatos (Venti)",
      "content": "Varka met Barbatos as a reckless young knight who went to the Thousand Winds Temple and fought its Ruin Guard; the commotion woke the Archon, and the two became friends. He got his Vision thrilled that the Anemo Archon had noticed him, then got to know Barbatos and realised \"that wasn't what it meant at all\". He knows Venti is the Archon and keeps the secret. He calls him carefree but serious when it counts, with good taste in drink, and owes him drinks.",
