      "key": [
        "Jean",
        "Acting Grand Master",
        "Dandelion Knight"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Varka: Jean",
      "content": "Jean credits Varka's teaching, along with her upbringing, for her devotion to duty, even though he takes duties lightly; what he leaves undone falls on her. He left her as Acting Grand Master when the expedition departed and told her that if he did not return, she would become Grand Master and train the next Knight of Boreas. He says she has the talent to be a far better Grand Master than he is, and she always says she is not qualified.",
