      "key": [
        "Boreas",
        "Lupus Boreas",
        "Andrius",
        "Wolf of the North",
        "Knight of Boreas",
        "Wolvendom"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Varka",
        "knight",
        "title",
        "wolf",
        "Grand Master"
      ],
      "comment": "Varka: Boreas and the Knight of Boreas",
      "content": "The Knight of Boreas is the bridge between Mondstadt's people and Lupus Boreas, the Wolf of the North among the Four Winds. Only a few holders in a millennium won the wolf lord's real recognition, among them Ravenwood, Rostam and Varka. Varka earned it the hard way: he spent days fighting Boreas in Wolvendom, first thrashed, then trading blows, to relearn a lost sword style.",
