    "4": {
      "uid": 4,
      "key": [
        "Lohen",
        "Sharpest Arrow",
        "Vice Captain of the 5th Company"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Varka: Lohen",
      "content": "Lohen is the battle-loving Vice Captain of the Knights' 5th Company. Varka first thought he was a younger version of himself; he learned Lohen cares only for fighting, not glory, and when bored digs traps to ambush his Grand Master. Varka approved his promotion and took him on the expedition after Lohen asked how the Knights could protect Mondstadt if they could not protect themselves.",
