      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Varka: Razor",
      "content": "Varka met Razor in the forests of Wolvendom when the boy was barely taller than the wolf pups. He gave him the name Razor and taught him to use a claymore; learning to talk with him took half a year. Razor remembers him as a big man with a \"big steelclaw\" and wants to see him again.",
